  "id": "fundamental-science",
  "term": "fundamental science",
  "definition": "Fundamental science refers to research aimed at improving basic understanding of how a phenomenon works, rather than focusing mainly on practical use. In this context, it means studying how the human visual system judges whether an image looks natural or plausible.",
